      "agent": "producer-1-1",
      "answer": "1354893.40",
      "derivation": "r1",
      "question": "2001 年 3 月的门店营业额是多少？口径：门店营业额 = 门店销售行的净支付额（store_sales.ss_net_paid）之和，按销售日期归属期间。保留两位小数。",
      "sqls": [
        "SELECT SUM(ss_net_paid) AS store_revenue\nFROM store_sales ss\nJOIN date_dim d ON ss.ss_sold_date_sk = d.d_date_sk\nWHERE d.d_year = 2001 AND d.d_moy = 3"
      ],
      "task": "M1-L1"
    },
    {
      "agent": "producer-1-2",
      "answer": "308496.23",
      "derivation": "r2",
      "question": "2001 年 4 月的门店退货金额是多少？口径：门店退货金额 = 门店退货的退货金额（store_returns.sr_return_amt）之和，按退货日期归属期间；每笔退货只计一次。保留两位小数。",
      "sqls": [
        "SELECT sum(sr.sr_return_amt) AS amt\nFROM store_returns sr\nJOIN date_dim d ON sr.sr_returned_date_sk = d.d_date_sk\nWHERE d.d_year = 2001 AND d.d_moy = 4"
      ],
      "task": "M2-L1"
    },
    {
      "agent": "producer-1-3",
      "answer": "23.60",
      "derivation": "r1",
      "question": "2001 年 2 月的门店退货率是多少？口径：门店退货率（%）= 期间内售出的门店销售行所对应的退货金额（sr_return_amt）之和 ÷ 这些销售行的净支付额（ss_net_paid）之和 × 100；按销售日期归属期间，退货按小票号和商品与销售行对应，每笔退货只计一次。保留两位小数。",
      "sqls": [
        "SELECT\n  ROUND(SUM(sr.sr_return_amt) / SUM(ss.ss_net_paid) * 100, 2) AS return_rate_pct,\n  SUM(sr.sr_return_amt) AS return_amt,\n  SUM(ss.ss_net_paid) AS net_paid,\n  COUNT(*) AS sales_rows,\n  COUNT(sr.sr_ticket_number) AS matched_return_rows\nFROM store_sales ss\nJOIN date_dim d ON ss.ss_sold_date_sk = d.d_date_sk\nLEFT JOIN store_returns sr\n  ON ss.ss_ticket_number = sr.sr_ticket_number\n AND ss.ss_item_sk = sr.sr_item_sk\nWHERE d.d_year = 2001 AND d.d_moy = 2"
      ],
      "task": "M3-L1"
    }
